# Internal planning docs — not user-facing.
#
# `docs/*` ignores every direct child, so anything meant to be tracked is
# re-admitted by name below. Plans and reports moved out of the repo root live
# in docs/plans/ and docs/reports/ and ARE tracked; docs/local/ is deliberately
# left ignored and holds the machine-local scratch that used to sit at the root.
docs/*
!docs/plans/
!docs/plans/**
!docs/reports/
!docs/reports/**
# Design references a plan points at - mockups meant to be opened in a browser.
!docs/design/
!docs/design/**
!docs/TOOL_COVERAGE.md
!docs/live-reports/
!docs/live-reports/*.json
!docs/OWNERS.md
!docs/WORKSPACE_FORENSICS.md
# Reference lifted out of README.md in 0.15.4 so the store page stops being
# contributor documentation. README links to all four, and vsce rewrites those
# links to absolute GitHub URLs at package time -- untracked here means a 404
# on the Marketplace Overview page.
!docs/COMMANDS.md
!docs/TOOL_SCHEMA_AUDIT.md
!docs/SHARED_RUNTIME.md
!docs/DELEGATION.md
!docs/SAFE_WORKER_TOOL_UPGRADE_PLAN.md
!docs/DELEGATION_UNBLOCK_PLAN.md
AUDIT_REPORT.md
FORGE_REPORT.md
AGENTS.md
